WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:01:56.740 --> 00:02:00.450
Excuse me... Could you repeat that, please?

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:03.090
I move that the Sorority be abolished!

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:14.930
My dear Brother...

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.730
Kaoru-no-Kimi made a courageous speech,

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:21.100
...and took the assembly in a totally unexpected direction.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.740
The student's frustration and resentment came to the surface.

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:29.210
It's a social caste system, for sure!

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:31.610
I've had it with those arrogant snobs!

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:36.750
A problem like this is not one for discussion solely among ourselves!

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:40.060
Please, don't allow your emotions to get out of control!

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.700
Who's out of control?

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:45.430
We're certain we can get the necessary two-thirds majority.

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:47.260
Go right ahead, then,

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:51.430
...if you think you can so easily abolish this venerated tradition.

00:02:55.370 --> 00:03:01.070
<b>30. The Petition</b>

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:05.850
As you who attended the assembly heard already,

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:08.340
...I have spoken out against the existence of the Sorority.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:11.720
All students must be equal.

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:14.370
No one should decide who is better than whom.

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:17.660
If you agree with this statement,

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:19.710
...please sign this petition.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:24.150
What's the matter?

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:26.600
Yesterday, everyone had a lot they wanted to say!

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.910
...about what a problem the Sorority was.

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:32.910
Won't the school board hold it against me if I sign?

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:37.060
The Sorority is so close to the School Board,

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:39.330
...I'm reluctant to risk signing my name.

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:43.050
The School Board consist of Sorority Alumni!

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:45.920
Do you think a petition will have any effect on the School Board?

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:49.170
But that's it! That's why we have to do it!

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:54.530
Do you want to stay at school that ignores petitions from the students?

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:59.370
Do you want to support the system that causes such a oppression?

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:02.540
Does this system even have the right to exist?

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:08.690
Whether you are the one injured,

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:10.390
...or you are the one causing the injury.

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:12.880
...you both are victims of the Sorority.

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:16.020
Our curriculum should teach us this:

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:19.660
...that all of us are free, and equal!

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:27.430
I'm available to take your signature whenever you are ready.

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:28.300
Bye!

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:38.560
I'll sign. I want to sign!

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:50.010
Is this OK?

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:52.160
Thank you.

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:52.960
Not at all...

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:55.650
I'll sign too.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:58.350
I agree with abolishing the Sorority too!

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.090
Me too! <i> </i>

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:01.060
Me too! And me!

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.500
What is it, Nanako?

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:10.780
I need a favor.

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:11.760
A favor?

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:12.770
Yes, a favor.

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:15.200
Now, at lunchtime?

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:18.260
Beginning with today's lunchtime... we want everyone to see us,

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:21.150
...so, won't you please give us a hand?

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:26.290
Kaoru-no-Kimi would carry on all alone, but the more the better.

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:30.270
Ha ha... well, I'm not someone who likes attracting attention, you know.

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:31.890
I'm actually kind of shy.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:37.150
As far as the Sorority goes, I guess you could say I was against it,

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:41.210
...but I don't really hate it enough to abolish it.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:45.010
That's right -- I remember you saying just the other day,

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:47.270
... "This isn't all the fault of the Sorority".

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:50.490
The whole Sorority thing, it's so alien to me, you know.

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:56.020
It's really more your thing than mine, after all.

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:56.810
I see.

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:57.550
I'm sorry.

00:05:57.910 --> 00:05:59.590
I'm the one who's sorry...

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.550
Oh, don't be silly.

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:02.280
Bye!

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:07.980
Why can't I ever do fashionable things like everyone else...

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:11.650
Please sign the petition!

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:15.240
Please sign to abolish the Sorority!

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:18.670
My dear brother... I'm surprised at myself.

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:20.680
I can't believe I'm doing this.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:25.120
But, it's not just me, there's Kaoru-no-Kimi too.

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:27.420
She's shouting into a megaphone.

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:30.450
I'd have thought this was totally unlike me,

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:33.660
...even more so than Tomoko.

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:35.600
Go for it!

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:37.230
Thank you!

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:43.500
Kaoru-no-Kimi, if I sign, would you autograph my notebook?

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:44.410
Me too! <i> </i>

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.050
Me too! Me too!

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:45.070
You must be kidding!
Me too! Me too!

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:46.400
You must be kidding!

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:49.280
Abolish the Sorority? She makes me so mad!

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:53.080
You're right! Until recently she was a member.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:56.250
How can that Misonoo-san girl change her position so quickly?

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:59.290
She sure seemed to enjoy the Sorority when she was a member.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:03.070
You know, she's just that type. Anything goes.

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:04.700
Just like her mother.

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:07.690
You didn't hear me say that!

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.440
But then again..!

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:15.960
OK - let's split up.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.550
I'll go the assembly hall

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:20.210
OK, then I'll take the garden.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:22.100
Go for it!

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:23.310
You too!

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:30.720
It's so strange... at first, my heart was pounding.

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:34.290
Then bit by bit I felt more positive.

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:37.720
I even began looking forward to doing it.

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:39.910
My dear brother...

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:42.770
Your Nanako is actually rather good at this!

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:47.060
Yes... sign your name there.

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:49.170
And don't forget your grade and section.

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:52.220
Don't push it! You made me scribble it!

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:55.400
I don't have to look good, as long as it's legible.

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:57.780
That's not nice, Saint-Juste-sama!

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:58.850
So, who's next? <i> </i>

00:07:58.970 --> 00:07:59.600
So, who's next? Me!

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:01.010
Me! Me too!

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:06.280
Please sign!

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:10.020
We have a petition to abolish the Sorority.

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:12.060
Please sign our petition!

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:15.660
Oh! Thank you!

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:18.320
You should be careful whom you ask.

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:22.900
You were a member, just like us.

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:24.800
Until recently!

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:28.910
You have no class at all.

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:30.970
It's no wonder that you were expelled.

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:32.820
I wasn't expelled!

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:34.240
I resigned on my own!

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:35.660
You're shameless!

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:45.880
Nakaya-san!

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:51.010
I know that you left on your own - unlike me...

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.310
Nakaya-san!

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:54.660
So, should I put my name and section?

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:55.700
Yes.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.780
Do you think I could help too? <i> </i>

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:03.540
Do you think I could help too? What? Really? Of course! Yes!

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:06.900
Tomoko!

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:10.230
This crusade may be a good thing,

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:12.350
...but skipping lunch isn't good.

00:09:12.470 --> 00:09:16.600
Really, Nanako! If I weren't looking after you all the time...

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:21.510
Don't misunderstand me. I'm no part of her crusade.

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:24.260
I'm just here to be Nanako's manager.

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:27.570
What. What are you smiling at...?

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:32.930
You! You, the nice lady there,

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.060
...just put your signature right here,

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:36.750
...you mustn't put up with the Sorority!

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:40.080
Yes, you too, this way please, come on, come on...!

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:42.800
I don't feel quite right about doing it like that...

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:46.290
It'll be OK! I have my own unique style at this.

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:47.820
Did she say anything?

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.360
No, nothing.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:51.660
We can't just do nothing.

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:54.160
I wish I knew what Miya-sama was thinking.

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:14.550
Wow... I did pretty well! I got five people.

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:16.550
Let's see... I have eight!

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:17.830
I have six!

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:21.740
I guess I'm a girl with a talent for getting signatures!

00:10:21.860 --> 00:10:23.350
You do have a talent, Tomoko!

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:25.730
So, the goal is a two-third majority...?

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:28.860
Yes. If we can get two-thirds of the students to sign,

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.400
...we can submit it directly to the school board.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:34.460
Let's work and get 10 more after school!

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:37.490
Great. Let's do that, then visit Shinobu-san.

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:38.800
At her house?

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:39.850
Sure!

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:42.370
How is Shinobu-san doing?

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.090
She's feeling much better.

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:45.030
Oh good.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:49.190
But she can't stop worrying about Misaki-san.

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:50.170
Misaki-san?

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:53.550
She gets really depressed sometimes over what she did to Misaki-san.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:02.350
What? You're not going to stop for tea with us?

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:05.370
Not today, I think.

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.470
Does it hurt?

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:09.210
Sure.

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:16.960
Misaki-san seems to be depressed since it happened.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:20.720
Yes... She's not assertive and confident like she usually is.

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:22.130
I liked her that way better.

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:25.620
It doesn't feel right - having tea, just us two.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:27.820
It doesn't feel right.

00:11:33.110 --> 00:11:36.010
Oh, Sonobe-san, Furuta-san...

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:38.440
Oh, Borgia-sama... Mona Lisa-sama!

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:42.030
We'd like to have a word with you, if you don't mind.

00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:47.170
So, how is Misaki-san's injury?

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:50.970
Well... she is getting much better...

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:54.430
But she doesn't really want to talk about it.

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:57.510
Is that so? Your coffee's getting cold...

00:11:57.630 --> 00:11:59.520
Oh... Yes!

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:01.000
By the way...

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:04.180
Perhaps you were aware that the Sorority has two vacancies now,

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:07.330
...due to the departure of Shinobu-san and Misonoo-san.

00:12:09.110 --> 00:12:10.660
And when we have a vacancy,

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:15.720
...we can choose another candidate from the freshmen.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:19.870
It should be quite a big occasion for the school.

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:24.210
There are many students who would want to be selected.

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:26.800
Yes. I guess so.

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:31.440
To tell the truth,

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:35.340
...we thought about recommending Misaki-san.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.020
What should we do?

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:48.530
Miya-sama is very concerned about this petition.

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:53.330
The thrust of this crusade is from your classmates.

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:55.410
What should we do?

00:12:55.530 --> 00:12:58.390
Perhaps, if she were helpful to us,

00:12:58.410 --> 00:12:59.940
...we could recommend her.

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:03.110
Being in the Sorority was a dream of Misaki-san's.

00:13:03.350 --> 00:13:06.470
Yes, since Junior High. Her more than anyone.

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:13.310
My dear brother...

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:16.540
Each person has their own way of thinking.

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:20.550
I was floating along, aimless and giddy,

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:23.360
...then something brought me back down to earth.

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:26.480
It's OK. They're in the locker room.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:43.570
It happened on the third day of the petition.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.700
We have to open it.

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:04.340
Uh... yeah.

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:15.160
Let's do it!

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:21.940
What are you doing?

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:23.620
That's the petition book.

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:26.940
Did you ask Kaoru if you could burn it?

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:29.540
I think not.

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:31.760
Most certainly not.

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.930
If you disagree with me, say so.

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:41.890
I don't hide from discussion.

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:45.620
But to do this, behind my back...

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:48.010
...it makes me sad.

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:51.510
Do you realize what you were doing?

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:55.440
Say something! Furuta-san! Sonobe-san!

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:58.480
I can't let the Sorority be abolished!

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:03.130
Yes, that's why I wanted to kill off this stupid campaign.

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:06.030
The rest of you too! You used to love the Sorority!

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:08.160
We'd like to hear the truth.

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:09.540
What do you mean?

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:12.610
This was Misaki-san's idea, wasn't it?

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.170
What?!!

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:15.290
That's enough.

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:17.660
Let's forget it.

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:19.850
The petition have been returned unharmed.

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:22.730
No, let me finish, Kaoru-no-Kimi...

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:26.490
You two! Misaki-san put you up to doing this, is that right?

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:29.450
Right! It's just the thing Misaki-san would come up with!

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:32.640
No! Absolutely not!

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:33.610
It's true!

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:37.180
Her accusation is true.

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:40.360
I asked Sonobe-san and Furuta-san to do this for me.

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:41.680
Misaki-san!

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:45.300
More than anyone, I wanted into the Sorority.

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:47.870
More than anyone, I admired the Sorority.

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:51.150
I had committed my heart to it,

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:54.570
...something that a mere opportunist like you wouldn't understand.

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:04.490
As soon as you were abandoned by Miya-sama,

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:06.470
...you ran off to join this petition campaign.

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:09.460
You'll grab anything good that gets within reach,

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:11.160
...just like your mother!

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:15.570
Misaki-san!

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:20.750
I resent that! How... how can you say such a thing!

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:24.210
You're... you're nothing more than a wretched failure!

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:35.180
Yes. I am wretched.

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:37.640
Is that so bad?

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:41.480
I don't mind.

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.000
Everyone else says that too.

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:54.420
Wait, Misaki-san! <i> </i>

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:55.570
Wait, Misaki-san! Misaki-san!

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:58.050
Why did you say such a thing?

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:01.580
We did it because Mona-Lisa-sama and Borgia-sama asked us!

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:03.640
You didn't ask us to do anything!

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:05.710
We did it on our own!

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:06.910
Misaki-san!

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:12.060
If you do this, you'll get the blame for everything!

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:14.440
Misaki-san!

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:17.130
Please, stop.

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:21.530
Please don't do me any more favors!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.200
Misaki-san...

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:26.430
Farewell.

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:34.810
It's the truth! We weren't lying!

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:36.930
We did everything on our own!

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:38.710
They said if we could help the Sorority,

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:41.590
...she'd be recommended for membership.

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:45.500
Really! Misaki-san didn't know anything!

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:48.240
Misaki-san wanted to protect us!

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:50.230
She wanted to help us!

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:52.070
Please! Believe us!

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:55.210
Now, everything will be her fault.

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:56.500
We were worried about her!

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:59.710
She seemed so depressed recently.

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:03.800
That's why... that's why we had to...

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:06.750
I hardly know what to say.

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:10.070
But I believe you.

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.890
Is that enough? Is it?

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:32.930
How long has it been...

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:36.450
...that I have been so detestable...?

00:18:38.820 --> 00:18:40.130
Aya-san!

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:42.420
It's time to take Halloween for walk!

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:44.950
Please!

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:46.630
Aya-san!

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:49.470
This is from the first year of junior high.

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:52.590
Here, look at this picture.

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:54.970
This was the fall tournament.

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:58.370
The preliminary, to choose the anchor runner for the class relay.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:02.080
I'd already felt a sense of rivalry towards her.

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:05.740
But at this point, the feeling became very strong.

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:09.960
No matter what, I couldn't allow her to beat me.

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:13.030
I'm sure she must've felt the same way.

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:24.370
She was first, I was second.

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:26.710
We'd passed the last turn, and were in the home straight.

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:37.710
Why? Why did you stop?

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:40.400
You'd have been the anchor if you hadn't stopped!

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:43.620
It meant nothing if I won because you fell.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:47.540
I wanted to beat you fair and square!

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:56.000
I was so furious.

00:19:56.530 --> 00:19:58.820
I absolutely hated her.

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:02.570
I resolved never to let this girl even see me smile.

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:05.560
Hate ran through my body like a fire.

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:14.670
But now... it's very strange.

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:20.440
We've been through a lot since then, and now...

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:25.130
Now all that's left is an appreciation of her.

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:30.120
All I remember is that she was very straight, and very fair.

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:37.560
Yes, she has some good qualities. I admit that.

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:40.900
Watching out for her friends, that's especially good.

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:50.980
I'm...

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:54.810
I'm going to apologize to Misaki-san!

00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:58.550
Today... today I said something terrible to her.

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:01.930
Is it OK, Mariko, if I go?

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:05.370
Why ask me?

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:07.950
Why do you have to ask me?

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:16.020
I'm sorry.

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:19.310
She went out walking her dog, and isn't back yet.

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:23.000
Usually she's back within half an hour.

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:25.160
Yes, she always goes to the beach.

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:28.110
Thank you! Let's go!

00:21:51.940 --> 00:21:54.390
Do you... do you love me?

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:06.260
Today, you'll be going home alone, Halloween.

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:23.770
Misaki-san!

00:22:25.980 --> 00:22:27.400
Misaki-san!

00:22:39.550 --> 00:22:40.740
I'll wait!

00:22:41.150 --> 00:22:42.570
I'm waiting for you!

00:22:44.520 --> 00:22:49.040
This time... if it turns out you're the one who falls,

00:22:49.160 --> 00:22:53.400
...then this time, I'll be the one who waits!

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:56.950
No, don't!

00:22:57.070 --> 00:22:58.590
If you do that, you'll not be the anchor!

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:14.400
My dear brother...

00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:17.020
It was the next day.

00:23:17.300 --> 00:23:22.150
Previously unthinkable names appeared on the petition.

00:23:22.490 --> 00:23:25.010
From the freshmen, section B: Furuta Megumi-san,

00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:26.810
...as well as Sonobe Miyuki-san.

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:28.950
And then, another...

00:23:29.790 --> 00:23:31.020
Misaki Aya-san.

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:44.530
Please help us out there!

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:49.260
Sign the petition to abolish the Sorority!

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...
